  "reason": "The best result so far is config_038 (0.7207: multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, concat). The evidence strongly favors scvi_n200 as RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l as image encoder, multiprofile, and concat over weighted fusion (0.7150 vs 0.7062 with avgpool). Config_039 (transformer + weighted) is the only untested cell in the 2×2 aggregation×fusion grid for this top-performing family. As the final experiment, it completes the characterization of the best configuration space and tests whether the small concat-over-weighted gap seen with avgpool holds or reverses under transformer aggregation. While the expected gain is modest, it is the most targeted exploitation of the strongest evidence and the only remaining untested variant in the proven best family, making it the best use of the last budget slot."
